\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Because of the Saviour's birthday
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 we are happy to-day
\par the sacrifice he made for us
\par ://: Is pleasing in our eyes ://:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. We have been wallowing in sin
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 satan suppresses us,
\par till he totally destroys us
\par ://: eternally in death ://:
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. But God does not delight in sin
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0  and he gave us His son
\par  To rescue us from Satan's grip
\par   ://:  and made us his children ://:
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  For this, we have our liberty
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0  and became God's children
\par  depending solely on Jesus
\par \pard  ://:and we worship Him well. ://:\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

